      "settings": {
        "eyebrow": "What we noticed",
        "image_asset": "os-shift-pets.png",
        "heading": "Pets are becoming part of our lives in a much deeper way",
        "body": "<p>Pets are no longer being brought home only for companionship or security, or looked at as simply another species. Increasingly, they are becoming a part of our lives in a much deeper way: a source of happiness, comfort, companionship and emotional well-being.</p><p>At a time when stress has become a part of everyday life across ages and generations, the simple presence of a pet can bring a smile, lift our mood and add a sense of joy to our day.</p>",
        "pull": "Having them around has, in many ways, become a little dose of happiness we look forward to.",
        "strip_label": "How the role of pets is changing",
